Engage effectively with functional stakeholders (e.g., Finance, PPM) to drive appropriate linkages and constructively pressure testing assumptions/ inputs&#xa0;
Work on continuous improvement efforts within Portfolio Insights to improve the team’s ability to act as proactive strategic advisors that leverage modernized approaches (including AI/ML based predictive solutions) to drive better-decision making for the Portfolio.&#xa0;
Conduct ad-hoc short-term analyses or strategic projects at leadership request&#xa0;
