7-10 years of experience with multi-faceted, broad based understanding of Pharma R&D business processes, investment stage gating and commercial processes; fewer years can be considered if candidate has advanced degrees (MBA, PhD)&#xa0;
Excellent analytical and problem-solving skills with attention to details&#xa0;
Experience with multi-faceted, broad based understanding of Pharma R&D business processes, investment stage gating and commercial processes&#xa0;
Demonstrated experience working in fast paced settings, with a proven track record of delivering high quality and insightful analyses&#xa0;
Effective oral and written communication skills with proven ability to tailor analytical outputs to different audiences&#xa0;
Strong presence in meetings with willingness to navigate different functional perspectives and push for “enterprise thinking”&#xa0;
Strong organizational and project management skills commensurate with conducting multiple sophisticated analyses across several assets&#xa0;
Prior experience in Management Consulting and track record of experience in R&D Strategy / Portfolio prioritization projects a plus&#xa0;
This role is hybrid requiring at least three (3) days onsite, Tuesday through Thursday&#xa0;in our AbbVie offices - North Chicago, IL or South San Francisco, CA.&#xa0;
This role requires up to ~20% travel.
